msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports.md
msgid ""
"`INFO` *format detected*, with `by` = `algorithm`, `url` or `algorithm "
"and url`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports.md
msgid "runs with that format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports.md
