#~ "Verbosity is today the one setting "
#~ "the command line has a monopoly "
#~ "on. `FREEPORTS_VERBOSITY` and the "
#~ "configuration file's `verbosity` key are "
#~ "parsed, validated and merged, but never"
#~ " reach the logging setup of the "
#~ "parent process — see the warning "
#~ "in {doc}`../configuration/index`."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "infer it from a URL, or fail"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The format name, as `metadata/formats.csv` "
#~ "of the repository synthesises it — "
#~ "`EURIZON-EN23`, `FINECO-EN23@LUX`, "
#~ "`MEDIOLANUM-IT24.A`."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Omit it and the engine tries to"
#~ " infer it from the URL of each"
#~ " document, using the repository's "
#~ "`url_mapping.csv`; the first matching prefix"
#~ " wins. Inference works only for "
#~ "documents that *have* a URL. Two "
#~ "documents inferring **different** formats is"
#~ " an error rather than a choice "
#~ "made silently. Giving `-f` explicitly "
#~ "while inference also succeeds and "
#~ "disagrees is a warning, not an "
#~ "error: you were explicit, so you "
#~ "win, but you are told."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The formats repository. Note that the"
